<title>USA: Billing Information Q2 shr down.</title>
<headline>Billing Information Q2 shr down.</headline>
<dateline>SAN ANTONIO 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In Thousands, Except Per Share Amounts)</p>
<p>					    Q2 Ended   Six Months Ended</p>
<p>					    March 31,	March 31,</p>
<p>					1997     1996     1997     1996</p>
<p> Operating revenues	  $27,382  $26,947  $55,200  $50,301</p>
<p> Cost of services	     16,936   16,839   34,894   32,145</p>
<p>    Gross profit		10,446   10,108   20,306   18,156</p>
